## The stores a test has
#
# **The engine branches on the `name` here too**, for the same reason it does for a role: `into:2`
# means nothing until the row is looked up.

{store id:1 name:script}
{store id:2 name:game}
{store id:3 name:expected}
{store id:4 name:actual}
